OL,3,GNEWSAFarmers hope jabs can save herd
OL,4,Afrom Bluetongue risk
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe owners of a dairy farm in
OL,7,FDerbyshire have opted to vaccinate
OL,8,Ftheir herd against bluetongue virus,
OL,9,Fsaying losing calves would be
OL,10,F"heartbreaking".
OL,12,FWhile the disease is rarely fatal for
OL,13,Fcattle, it can cause cows to miscarry
OL,14,Fand reduce milk yields. Cases of the
OL,15,Fdisease are on the rise in the UK,
OL,16,Fparticularly in the South West of
OL,17,FEngland.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
