OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSAFarmers hope jabs can save herd
OL,4,Afrom Bluetongue risk
OL,5,
OL,6,FJessica White, who manages a 500-strong
OL,7,Fherd of dairy cows in Shottle, near
OL,8,FBelper, said she and her husband Paul
OL,9,Fhad opted to vaccinate their herd as an
OL,10,Foutbreak would be "unthinkable".
OL,12,FBut vets have warned that supplies of
OL,13,Fthe jab remain low and that some
OL,14,Ffarmers may have to wait before their
OL,15,Fanimals can be vaccinated.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
